    {
      "text": "CTCAC CA-26-627: Cleveland Commons, located at 60 West Hamilton Avenue in Campbell on a 1.21 acre site, requested and is being recommended for a reservation of $2,818,910 in annual federal tax credits, $7,050,757 in total state tax credits, and $17,080,193 of tax-exempt bond cap to finance the new construction of 92 units of housing, consisting of 91 restricted rental units and 1 unrestricted manager's unit.",
