        "SRC-001683"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQAnet SCH 2026020606: Notice of Exemption, ministerial (Sec. 21080(b)(1); 15268), received 2/17/2026; lead agency Santa Clara County, contact Santa Clara County Office of Supportive Housing; applicant Charities Housing (Marvel Ang, Director of Housing Development); 104 units on 1.2 acres, APN 305-21-003.",
