        "SRC-003071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City planning data: PLN-2024-51 described a 5-story 100% affordable project of up to 104 units under SB 35 and density bonus law. PLN-2024-60 was a request by Charities and SCMRF for a city support letter for funding applications for the 60 W. Hamilton project.",
